["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasContactPoint", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Artifact has each `to` Agent as a contact point. The use of `hasContactPoint` type is constrained to `ContactPointRelationship` typed relationships. The type of contact (i.e. security) may be specified using a `ContactPointRelationship` element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
